# Optional. A GitHub token raises the API rate limit from 60 to 5000 requests/hour.
# It is read ONLY inside server-side route handlers and is never sent to the browser.
# A classic token with NO scopes (or a fine-grained token with "Public repositories: read")
# is enough, because Repo Time Machine only reads public repositories.
GITHUB_TOKEN=

# Optional. Serve local fixtures instead of calling GitHub. Used by the e2e suite.
# RTM_FIXTURE_MODE=1
